+| `prompt-review` | Intermediate | Input params, cross-agent reads | Phase 4 |
+| `smoke-test` | Advanced | Full lifecycle test | Phase 5 |
+| `feedback-digest` | Advanced | Cross-agent aggregation | Phase 5 |
